      "ppv:year": "2026",
      "ppv:quarter": {"@id": "ppv:review-q1-2026"},
      "ppv:biggestWins": "Proposal planning is real and moving. Wedding bands are nearly done. Jack tutoring continues strong. Home AI lab got started with Tailscale.",
      "ppv:biggestChallenges": "Time. There's never enough. Career work and mental health habits keep getting squeezed out by the day job and the things that feel urgent.",
      "ppv:focusAreas": "Get Zabbix upgrade done. Start journaling — even 5 minutes. Write back to Joseph and Adrianna. Don't let another month pass.",
